{"asset_key":"ep3/env_story_13304170","episode":"ep3","category":"env_story","story_id":"13304170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1330417001:1":{"text":"米诺，虽然你很擅长植物学，但我们这次来这里是来考古的……","source_cn":"米诺，虽然你很擅长植物学，但我们这次来这里是来考古的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2272B5819D73C037","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1330417002:1":{"text":"我确实在考古！你难道没听这里的人说过，这些蓝绒花是“由昔年英雄们的鲜血所浇灌而生长”。","source_cn":"我确实在考古！你难道没听这里的人说过，这些蓝绒花是“由...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA761807F3EB66E2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1330417003:1":{"text":"如果是这样的话，那么蓝绒花的分布不是应该和当年神魔大战的战场对应吗？","source_cn":"如果是这样的话，那么蓝绒花的分布不是应该和当年神魔大战...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE87F1F99455BE49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:瓦尔瓦拉":{"text":"瓦尔瓦拉","source":"瓦尔瓦拉","status":"source"},"speaker:米诺":{"text":"米诺","source":"米诺","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}